The JALR at 0x5bc55c is a top-down walk of a function-pointer table:
  0x5bc544 sll v0,s0,2 / 0x5bc548 lui s1,0x61 / 0x5bc54c addiu s1,s1,0x6f24 / 0x5bc550 addu s1,s1,v0
