The recorded s1=0x6174E4 is POST-decrement, so the lw that supplied v0 read 0x6174E8 => s0=369: the
loop walks the table DOWNWARD and 0x594430 was the FIRST of 369 calls. Every other entry is the same
hole, one instruction away.

